That means there are only a few thousand reads total in each file!
We can easily dump the ENTIRE CRAM files to SAM format using `htsjdk.samtools.SAMFileWriterFactory` or simply iterate over all records and write them out to `/tmp/tumor.sam` and `/tmp/normal.sam`!
